+    {"id": "F2", "fact": "All enemies gain 1% penetration per area level, max 75% at area level 75+, applied after the resistance cap; overcap does not help against penetration; at area 75+ capped resistance is the balanced baseline and below cap is effectively negative", "sources": ["https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46361871026971-Penetrations (updated 2026-02-24, accessed 2026-10-02)", "https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46363284011419-If-75-resistance-is-the-max-and-the-enemies-get-penetration-per-level-up-to-75-do-I-need-150-resistance (updated 2026-02-12, accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F3", "fact": "Overcap resistance only absorbs resistance-reducing effects: resistance shreds, Shock, Poison stacks, Marked for Death (-25% all resistances, 8 s)", "sources": ["https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46361887879963-Negative-Ailments (updated 2026-02-14, accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F4", "fact": "Versus players: resistance shred 2% per stack, max 10 stacks (max -20%), 4 s; Shock -2% lightning resistance and +8% stun chance per stack, max 10; Poison self-shred -2% poison resistance per stack, first 30 stacks (max -60%); armor shred -100 armor per stack, unlimited, 4 s, no player reduction listed (U1)", "sources": ["https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46361887879963-Negative-Ailments (updated 2026-02-14, accessed 2026-10-02)", "https://forum.lastepoch.com/t/the-convergence-update-beta-0-9-patch-notes/51975 (stack cap 10, accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F5", "fact": "Armor reduces all hits, 70% as effective against non-physical, mitigation cap 85% (59.5% non-physical), scales down with area level, no effect on DoT; armor-applies-to-DoT exists only on specific items the mod cannot see", "sources": ["https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46361891210651-Armor (updated 2026-07-13, accessed 2026-10-02)", "https://www.lastepochtools.com/db/items/IIwBgTCkBySQ (accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F6", "fact": "Endurance: base 20%, threshold base 20% of max health, cap 60%, threshold uncapped; reduces the part of hits and DoT below the threshold including the crossing part; does not apply to ward", "sources": ["https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46361855013787-Endurance (updated 2026-02-13, accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F7", "fact": "Ward takes damage before health, no cap, decays (retention slows, decay threshold floors); only Arena Echoes traps bypass it and they cannot kill; ward versus DoT believed yes but not explicit (U2)", "sources": ["https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46361876030235-Ward (updated 2026-07-14, accessed 2026-10-02)", "https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46363263694235-What-is-Ward-and-can-damage-bypass-it (updated 2026-02-20, accessed 2026-10-02)", "https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46361875581211-Hit-Vs-Damage-Over-Time (updated 2026-02-13, accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F8", "fact": "Enemy hits: 5% base crit chance, fixed 200% crit multiplier; critical strike avoidance rolls after attacker crit chance and multiplies it, cap 100% means never crit; less bonus damage taken from crits caps at 100%; DoT cannot crit", "sources": ["https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46361891709211-Critical-Strikes (updated 2026-02-13, accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F9", "fact": "Critical Vulnerability: +2% chance to receive a crit and -10% critical strike avoidance per stack, max 10 stacks, 4 s; breaks capped avoidance", "sources": ["https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46361887879963-Negative-Ailments (updated 2026-02-14, accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F10", "fact": "Dodge: chance from rating, lower at higher area level, cap 85% (rule of thumb rating = 10 x area level gives about 50%); dodging avoids the hit and its ailments; DoT cannot be dodged", "sources": ["https://www.lastepochtools.com/guide/section/dodge (accessed 2026-10-02)", "https://maxroll.gg/last-epoch/resources/defenses-explained (accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F11", "fact": "Block: chance rolls on every hit including spells; blocked hit mitigated by block effectiveness, scales with area level, cap 85%; blocking counts as being hit; DoT cannot be blocked", "sources": ["https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46361876155547-Block (updated 2026-07-14, accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F12", "fact": "Glancing blow: 35% less hit damage, chance cap 100%, hits only", "sources": ["https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46361871332251-Glancing-Blow (updated 2026-02-13, accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F13", "fact": "Stun: base 0.4 s; non-player hits must exceed 5% of target max health to have any stun chance; every 100 stun avoidance raises the threshold 1%; players have 250 + 5 per level inherent; Shock raises stun chance", "sources": ["https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46361891772443-Stun (updated 2026-02-13, accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F14", "fact": "Freeze: base 1.2 s; chance is attacker freeze rate divided by target (max health + current ward); first 15 Frostbite stacks each add 20% increased freeze chance", "sources": ["https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46361855307035-Freeze (updated 2026-07-14, accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F15", "fact": "Corruption raises monster health and damage (no official per-point formula; 0.5% per point is a 2023 community figure, outdated); empowered monoliths are area level 100 starting at 100 corruption; echo modifiers exist that reduce player resistances, raise enemy crit chance, or raise enemy damage", "sources": ["https://support.lastepoch.com/hc/en-us/articles/46363308884635-What-is-affected-by-Corruption (updated 2026-02-12, accessed 2026-10-02)", "https://maxroll.gg/last-epoch/monolith/empowered-guide (accessed 2026-10-02)", "https://maxroll.gg/last-epoch/monolith/the-last-ruin-timeline-guide (accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
+    {"id": "F16", "fact": "Community health floors for level 100 content: under 2000 HP is very low, 3000 to 3500 comfortable, ward builds 4000 to 5000 ward; community guidance, always Medium confidence", "sources": ["https://forum.lastepoch.com/t/what-do-you-do-to-solve-your-survivability-when-you-first-reach-empowered-monos/73162 (accessed 2026-10-02)", "https://www.thegamer.com/last-epoch-all-defensive-layers-explained/ (accessed 2026-10-02)", "https://steamcommunity.com/app/899770/discussions/0/4295943164872849597/ (accessed 2026-10-02)"]},
